        "values": {
          "eyebrow": "",
          "heading": "",
          "body": "<strong>Truck Country® / Stoops Freightliner-Western Star</strong> is one of the largest Freightliner dealership group in the U.S. today, serving customers at locations in Illinois, Iowa, Indiana, Ohio, Michigan, and Wisconsin. For nearly 60 years, Truck Country/Stoops has offered new and used medium and heavy duty trucks, expert service, an extensive parts inventory, and convenient financing options. Our brands include Freightliner, Western Star, Wabash and Autocar.\n\n<strong>Truck Country® / Stoops Freightliner-Western Star</strong> is part of McCoy Group, Inc., which was founded in 1958 by Robert McCoy in Shullsburg, WI. Today the company is still family-owned and is operated under the leadership of the McCoy family.",
          "image": {
